#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.to_csv.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.to\\_csv"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:1 of
msgid "Write LiteFrame to a comma-separated values (csv) file."
msgstr "将 LiteFrame 写入逗号分隔值 (csv) 文件。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:3 of
msgid "Simplified version for LiteFrame with no index semantics."
msgstr "LiteFrame 的简化版本，没有索引语义。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:5 of
msgid ""
"File path. If path is a string with wildcard e.g. '/to/path/out-*.csv', "
"to_csv will try to write multiple files, for instance, chunk (0, 0) will "
"write data into '/to/path/out-0.csv'. If path is a string without "
"wildcard, all data will be written into a single file."
msgstr ""
"文件路径。如果路径是带有通配符的字符串，例如 '/to/path/out-*.csv'，to_csv"
" 将尝试写入多个文件，例如，块 (0, 0) 将数据写入 '/to/path/out-0.csv'。"
"如果路径是不带通配符的字符串，所有数据将写入单个文件。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:12 of
msgid "String of length 1. Field delimiter for the output file."
msgstr "长度为1的字符串。输出文件的字段分隔符。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:14 of
msgid "Missing data representation."
msgstr "缺失数据表示。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:16 of
msgid "Format string for floating point numbers."
msgstr "浮点数的格式字符串。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:18 of
msgid "Columns to write."
msgstr "要写入的列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:20 of
msgid ""
"Write out the column names. If a list of strings is given it is assumed "
"to be aliases for the column names."
msgstr "写出列名。如果给定一个字符串列表，则假定它是列名的别名。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:23 of
msgid "Python write mode, default 'w'."
msgstr "Python 写入模式，默认为 'w'。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:25 of
msgid ""
"A string representing the encoding to use in the output file, defaults to"
" 'utf-8'."
msgstr "表示输出文件中使用的编码的字符串，默认为 'utf-8'。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:28 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If str, represents compression mode. If dict, value at 'method' is the "
"compression mode. Compression mode may be any of the following possible "
"values: {'infer', 'gzip', 'bz2', 'zip', 'xz', None}. If compression mode "
"is 'infer' and `path_or_buf` is path-like, then detect compression mode "
"from the following extensions: '.gz', '.bz2', '.zip' or '.xz'. (otherwise"
" no compression). If dict given and mode is 'zip' or inferred as 'zip', "
"other entries passed as additional compression options."
msgstr ""
"如果是字符串，表示压缩模式。如果是字典，'method' 处的值是压缩模式。压缩"
"模式可以是以下可能值中的任何一个：{'infer', 'gzip', 'bz2', 'zip', 'xz', "
"None}。如果压缩模式是 'infer' 且 `path_or_buf` 是类似路径的，则从以下"
"扩展名检测压缩模式：'.gz', '.bz2', '.zip' 或 '.xz'。(否则不压缩)。如果"
"给定字典且模式是 'zip' 或被推断为 'zip'，其他条目作为额外的压缩选项传递。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:37 of
msgid ""
"Defaults to csv.QUOTE_MINIMAL. If you have set a `float_format` then "
"floats are converted to strings and thus csv.QUOTE_NONNUMERIC will treat "
"them as non-numeric."
msgstr ""
"默认为 csv.QUOTE_MINIMAL。如果您设置了 `float_format` 则浮点数被转换为"
"字符串，因此 csv.QUOTE_NONNUMERIC 会将它们视为非数值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:41 of
msgid "String of length 1. Character used to quote fields."
msgstr "长度为1的字符串。用于引用字段的字符。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:43 of
msgid ""
"The newline character or character sequence to use in the output file. "
"Defaults to `os.linesep`, which depends on the OS in which this method is"
" called ('\\n' for linux, '\\r\\n' for Windows, i.e.)."
msgstr ""
"在输出文件中使用的换行符或字符序列。默认为 `os.linesep`，它取决于调用此"
"方法的操作系统('\\n' 表示linux，'\\r\\n' 表示Windows等)。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:47 of
msgid "Rows to write at a time."
msgstr "一次写入的行数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:49 of
msgid "Format string for datetime objects."
msgstr "datetime 对象的格式字符串。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:51 of
msgid "Control quoting of `quotechar` inside a field."
msgstr "控制字段内 `quotechar` 的引用。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:53 of
msgid ""
"String of length 1. Character used to escape `sep` and `quotechar` when "
"appropriate."
msgstr "长度为1的字符串。适当时用于转义 `sep` 和 `quotechar` 的字符。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:56 of
msgid "Character recognized as decimal separator. E.g. use ',' for European data."
msgstr "被识别为小数分隔符的字符。例如，对欧洲数据使用 ','。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:59 of
msgid ""
"Column names by which to partition the dataset. Columns are partitioned "
"in the order they are given."
msgstr "用于分割数据集的列名。列按给定顺序进行分割。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:62 of
msgid "Extra options that make sense for a particular storage connection."
msgstr "对特定存储连接有意义的额外选项。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:65 of
msgid "Returns a stub LiteFrame for execution."
msgstr "返回用于执行的存根 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:70 of
msgid ":py:obj:`read_csv`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:71 of
msgid "Load a CSV file into a LiteFrame."
msgstr "将 CSV 文件加载到 LiteFrame 中。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:73 of
msgid ":py:obj:`to_parquet`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_csv.to_csv:74 of
msgid "Write a LiteFrame to a Parquet file."
msgstr "将 LiteFrame 写入 Parquet 文件。"

